1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Meet Mimi: report triage for open-source
maintainers.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
It organizes evidence so a person can
decide what to do.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Mimi never closes a report on its own.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
This labelled replay uses
fixed sample data.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Explore the interface without an account,
key, or provider credits.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,000
No provider calls. Timestamps and findings
are fixture data, not live.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:47,000
The sample pipeline extracts a claim and
grounds the package.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:57,000
It checks public advisories and proposes
bounded test hypotheses.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Then it builds an environment and runs
isolated forks.

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:15,000
The dossier compares a fixed version and
prepares a verdict with a reply draft.

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Follow each recorded stage in the sample
dossier.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:31,000
It shows the claim, package, public
advisory references, and two hypotheses.

13
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:39,000
The zero-trigger result is fixture data.

14
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
It doesn't prove a real report reproduces.

15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,000
A Contradicted result needs completed
execution and stated coverage.

16
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Grounding alone never rejects. The reply
remains a draft.

17
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Nebius Token Factory and Nemotron
support language tasks.

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Tavily looks up public identifiers.

19
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Untrusted proof-of-concept code is
intended to run in Nebius Sandboxes.

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:18,000
A harmless no-op confirmed Mimi's child
namespace; outbound TCP was blocked.

21
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Isolation against hostile code is not
verified.

22
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:31,000
This replay is fixture data, not a live
vulnerability analysis.

23
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The 11-case pilot had four oracle fires,
but zero fixed-version confirmations.

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:49,000
None of five fabricated reports was
Contradicted. Four went to Needs human;
one falsely reached Likely after a trigger.

25
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Tavily's limit blocked advisory lookups; this
sample does not show useful slop detection.
Provider-level isolation is unverified.
